  "section": "3.98",
  "rulesText": "Whenever you finish a Long Rest, choose one type of land: arid, polar, temperate, or tropical. Consult the table below that corresponds to the chosen type; you have the spells listed for your Druid level and lower prepared.\n\nArid Land\n\nPolar Land\n\nTemperate Land\n\nTropical Land",
